{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/extras/d5ee9521ca4a4888163928d85f6e77f4.avif?t=1765211177\" width=1292 height=419 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember defending that beach? The rush of artillery fire, scrambling to man different positions as enemy forces stormed ashore? That feeling is back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeachHead Gold Edition brings together three classic titles - <strong>BeachHead 2000, BeachHead 2002, and BeachHead 2003 (Desert War)</strong> - fully optimized for modern Windows systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/extras/d780a710f5ad3ec5667c09fe4eef6aaa.avif?t=1765211177\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Three Full Games:</strong> BeachHead 2000, 2002, and 2003 (Desert War) - complete and working on Windows 10/11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Level Editor Included:</strong> Create custom battles and share them with the community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Community Leaderboards:</strong> Compete on rankings for both original and player-created levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Fixed &amp; Optimized:</strong> Mouse sensitivity issues resolved, everything just works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/extras/801cb319c02de1d1ce00c8cce43c7ec3.avif?t=1765211177\" width=522 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're returning to relive those late-night gaming sessions or discovering these classics for the first time, this is the definitive BeachHead collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beach is waiting. The enemy is landing. Are you ready to defend it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/extras/3481dccc2aace359119983c671b28b51.avif?t=1765211177\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Compatibility Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic BeachHead games were originally built more than 20 years ago using <strong>DirectDraw</strong>, a legacy graphics system no longer fully supported by modern Windows versions. To ensure better compatibility, this release includes <strong>DDrawCompat</strong>, a widely used open-source DirectDraw wrapper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Should Know</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These games were designed for <strong>4:3, 640\u00d7480</strong> resolutions. Depending on your monitor, you may see pillarboxing, stretching, or minor scaling artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although DDrawCompat significantly improves stability and rendering on modern PCs, <strong>some systems may still require small adjustments</strong>, such as disabling fullscreen optimizations or running in windowed mode.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2950610?t=1765211177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765211177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765211177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765211177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/extras/d5ee9521ca4a4888163928d85f6e77f4.avif?t=1765211177\" width=1292 height=419 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember defending that beach? The rush of artillery fire, scrambling to man different positions as enemy forces stormed ashore? That feeling is back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeachHead Gold Edition brings together three classic titles - <strong>BeachHead 2000, BeachHead 2002, and BeachHead 2003 (Desert War)</strong> - fully optimized for modern Windows systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950610/extras/d780a710f5ad3ec5667c09fe4eef6aaa.avif?t=1765211177\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Three Full Games:</strong> BeachHead 2000, 2002, and 2003 (Desert War) - complete and working on Windows 10/11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Level Editor Included:</strong> Create custom battles and share them with the community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Community Leaderboards:</strong> Compete on rankings for both original and player-created levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Fixed &amp; Optimized:</strong> Mouse sensitivity issues resolved, everything just works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas